       <p><b>Move:</b> tap/click an adjacent room tile, or use <b>WASD / arrow keys</b>. One move = one wax. <b>Space</b> waits (burns 1 wax).</p>
       <p><b>One key per floor.</b> Find the floor's <b>key</b>, then reach a <b>Descending Stair</b> and press <b>Descend</b>. The stair gate stays locked until you hold that floor's key. On the ground floor the key also opens the exit.</p>
       <p><b>Creatures:</b> <b>Run</b> costs <b>wax</b> (candle stays lit); <b>Endure</b> <b>snuffs the candle</b> and costs no wax — spend a <b>match</b> to re-light it. No match, no light. There is no HP and no battle.</p>
+      <p><b>Traps (floor 2 down):</b> exploration's obstacle — never a puzzle. <b>Go around</b> and lose turns (turns are wax); or <b>spring it</b> and the flame is <b>snuffed</b>, then spend a <b>match</b> to re-light. Each trap is telegraphed before you commit, and a trap's room is never on the path to the key or a refill.</p>
       <p><b>Matches</b> re-light a snuffed candle (they do not add wax).</p>
       <p><b>Survivors (floor 2 down):</b> six actions. <span class="warm">Warm</span> acts (share light, ally, bargain, trade) lower Dread but cost light. <span class="cold">Cold</span> acts (steal, threaten) buy light now but raise Dread.</p>
       <p><b>Dread (0–8)</b> is weather: it starts strangers warier and speeds Orlok when your flame dies. Warm acts make it roll away.</p>
